{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-code-review-in-ci","title":"CI 中的 AI 代码审查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/ai-code-review-in-ci","wordCount":1195,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-中的-ai-代码审查\">CI 中的 AI 代码审查</h1><p>代码审查是 CI 流水线中最高频、最耗时的质量门之一。2026 年的工程实践已经表明，AI 代码审查不是要替代人工审查，而是充当第一道过滤层：在人类审查者介入之前，完成风格一致性检查、常见缺陷模式识别、安全漏洞扫描，让人类审查者的注意力集中在架构决策和业务逻辑上。</p>\n<p>本文覆盖 CI 中 AI 代码审查的集成模式、工具选型、Prompt 设计原则，以及避免审查噪音的实践经验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>第一道防线模式</strong>（First-Pass Review）指 AI 审查在人工审查之前运行，承担机械性检查任务，不进行架构意图判断。此模式的有效性边界：AI 审查擅长风格一致性、常见 bug 模式、安全漏洞嗅探，不擅长架构合理性、团队历史决策符合性、意图匹配（PR 描述与实际变更的一致性）。</p>\n<p><strong>行内注释</strong>（Inline Comment）是 AI 审查产出的主要形式，通过 GitHub/GitLab API 将发现直接标注在 diff 的具体行上，比摘要报告更具行动导向性。</p>\n<p><strong>审查疲劳</strong>（Review Fatigue）指工程师因 AI 产出过多误报而逐渐忽略所有 AI 评论的现象。这是 AI 代码审查部署失败的最常见原因，需要通过控制噪音和保持高信噪比来预防。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主流工具的集成模式\">主流工具的集成模式</h2><p>2026 年 CI 中 AI 代码审查的主流工具形成了三种集成路径：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注：早期 GitHub PR 自动化产品线已发生洗牌——Sweep 已于 2024 年转向 JetBrains IDE 插件方向，不再是 PR 审查生态的现行选项；&quot;Copilot for PRs&quot; 作为旧称也已演进为两条独立产品线：<strong>Copilot code review</strong>（PR 审查）与 <strong>Copilot cloud agent</strong>（从 issue/评论出发在托管环境完成实现并回开 PR，见 <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/concepts/agents/coding-agent/about-coding-agent\">GitHub 文档</a>）。同类云端实现型 agent 还包括 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/cloud\">OpenAI Codex cloud</a> 与 <a href=\"https://jules.google.com/\">Google Jules</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PR[PR 提交] --&gt; TRIGGER{触发方式}&#10;&#10;    TRIGGER --&gt;|GitHub Actions| GH[GitHub Copilot Code Review\\nClaude Code GitHub Action]&#10;    TRIGGER --&gt;|第三方 SaaS| SaaS[CodeRabbit / Greptile\\nEllipsis / Qodo PR-Agent]&#10;    TRIGGER --&gt;|自建 Agent| CUSTOM[自建 LLM Review Bot\\n+ OpenAI / Anthropic API]&#10;&#10;    GH --&gt; INLINE[行内评论]&#10;    SaaS --&gt; INLINE&#10;    CUSTOM --&gt; INLINE&#10;&#10;    INLINE --&gt; GATE{门控判断}&#10;    GATE --&gt;|critical 发现| BLOCK[阻断合并]&#10;    GATE --&gt;|warning 发现| WARN[可见告警,人工确认]&#10;    GATE --&gt;|pass| MERGE[允许继续]\">flowchart TD\n    PR[PR 提交] --&gt; TRIGGER{触发方式}\n\n    TRIGGER --&gt;|GitHub Actions| GH[GitHub Copilot Code Review\\nClaude Code GitHub Action]\n    TRIGGER --&gt;|第三方 SaaS| SaaS[CodeRabbit / Greptile\\nEllipsis / Qodo PR-Agent]\n    TRIGGER --&gt;|自建 Agent| CUSTOM[自建 LLM Review Bot\\n+ OpenAI / Anthropic API]\n\n    GH --&gt; INLINE[行内评论]\n    SaaS --&gt; INLINE\n    CUSTOM --&gt; INLINE\n\n    INLINE --&gt; GATE{门控判断}\n    GATE --&gt;|critical 发现| BLOCK[阻断合并]\n    GATE --&gt;|warning 发现| WARN[可见告警,人工确认]\n    GATE --&gt;|pass| MERGE[允许继续]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具路径</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Copilot code review</td>\n<td>零配置、深度集成 GitHub</td>\n<td>规则定制有限</td>\n<td>小团队快速起步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Code GitHub Action</td>\n<td>推理能力强、支持自定义规则</td>\n<td>按 token 计费、需要维护</td>\n<td>需要深度定制的团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方 SaaS（CodeRabbit 等）</td>\n<td>开箱即用、规则库丰富</td>\n<td>成本固定但有订阅价</td>\n<td>中等规模团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全自建</td>\n<td>完全可控、可集成私有规则库</td>\n<td>工程维护成本高</td>\n<td>大型企业有合规要求的团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-集成实现\">GitHub Actions 集成实现</h2><p>基于 Claude Code 或 OpenAI 的自建 PR Review Action：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ai-code-review.yml&#10;name: AI Code Review&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    types: [opened, synchronize, reopened]&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: read&#10;  pull-requests: write&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  ai-review:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;&#10;      - name: Generate PR diff&#10;        id: diff&#10;        run: |&#10;          git diff origin/${{ github.base_ref }}...HEAD \\&#10;            -- &#39;:!vendor/**&#39; &#39;:!**/*.generated.*&#39; &#39;:!package-lock.json&#39; \\&#10;            &gt; pr_diff.patch&#10;          echo &quot;lines=$(wc -l &lt; pr_diff.patch)&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;&#10;      - name: Run AI Review&#10;        env:&#10;          ANTHROPIC_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          PR_NUMBER: ${{ github.event.pull_request.number }}&#10;          REPO: ${{ github.repository }}&#10;          DIFF_LINES: ${{ steps.diff.outputs.lines }}&#10;        run: node .github/scripts/ai-review.mjs&#10;&#10;      - name: Gate on Critical Findings&#10;        run: |&#10;          CRITICAL=$(jq &#39;.summary.critical&#39; review-result.json)&#10;          if [ &quot;$CRITICAL&quot; -gt &quot;0&quot; ]; then&#10;            echo &quot;::error::Found $CRITICAL critical issues. Review required before merging.&quot;&#10;            exit 1&#10;          fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ai-code-review.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AI Code Review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    types</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opened</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">synchronize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">reopened</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull-requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ai-review</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Generate PR diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git diff origin/${{ github.base_ref }}...HEAD \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            -- ':!vendor/**' ':!**/*.generated.*' ':!package-lock.json' \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            > pr_diff.patch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"lines=$(wc -l &#x3C; pr_diff.patch)\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run AI Review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          PR_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.event.pull_request.number }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          REPO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.repository }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          DIFF_LINES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.diff.outputs.lines }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">node .github/scripts/ai-review.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Gate on Critical Findings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          CRITICAL=$(jq '.summary.critical' review-result.json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          if [ \"$CRITICAL\" -gt \"0\" ]; then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            echo \"::error::Found $CRITICAL critical issues. Review required before merging.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            exit 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          fi</span></span></code></pre></div><p>核心 review 脚本的关键逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// .github/scripts/ai-review.mjs&#10;const SYSTEM_PROMPT = `You are a senior code reviewer. Review the provided diff for:&#10;1. Critical bugs and logic errors (mark as &#39;critical&#39;)  &#10;2. Security vulnerabilities: SQL injection, XSS, hardcoded secrets (mark as &#39;critical&#39;)&#10;3. Performance anti-patterns: N+1 queries, unbounded loops (mark as &#39;warning&#39;)&#10;4. Code style inconsistencies (mark as &#39;suggestion&#39;)&#10;&#10;Output JSON: { findings: [{file, line, severity, category, message, suggestion}], summary: {critical, warning, suggestion} }&#10;Focus on actionable, specific findings. Skip stylistic nits that a linter would catch.`;&#10;&#10;async function reviewDiff(diffContent, prContext) {&#10;  // 超过 500 行则分块处理&#10;  if (diffContent.split(&#39;\\n&#39;).length &gt; 500) {&#10;    return reviewInChunks(diffContent, prContext);&#10;  }&#10;  const response = await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;    model: &#39;claude-opus-4-5&#39;,&#10;    max_tokens: 4096,&#10;    system: SYSTEM_PROMPT,&#10;    messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: `PR Context: ${JSON.stringify(prContext)}\\n\\nDiff:\\n${diffContent}` }],&#10;  });&#10;  return JSON.parse(response.content[0].text);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .github/scripts/ai-review.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `You are a senior code reviewer. Review the provided diff for:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1. Critical bugs and logic errors (mark as 'critical')  </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2. Security vulnerabilities: SQL injection, XSS, hardcoded secrets (mark as 'critical')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3. Performance anti-patterns: N+1 queries, unbounded loops (mark as 'warning')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4. Code style inconsistencies (mark as 'suggestion')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Output JSON: { findings: [{file, line, severity, category, message, suggestion}], summary: {critical, warning, suggestion} }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Focus on actionable, specific findings. Skip stylistic nits that a linter would catch.`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reviewDiff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">diffContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 超过 500 行则分块处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (diffContent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reviewInChunks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(diffContent, prContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anthropic.messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-opus-4-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_tokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    system: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages: [{ role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, content: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`PR Context: ${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prContext</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Diff:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">diffContent</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response.content[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"prompt-设计原则\">Prompt 设计原则</h2><p>AI 代码审查的 Prompt 质量直接决定误报率和覆盖率。关键设计原则：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 明确告知不审查的范围</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Skip reviewing:&#10;- Generated files (*.generated.*, protobuf output)&#10;- Vendor/third-party code&#10;- Minor formatting issues that a linter should catch&#10;- Comments and documentation unless factually wrong\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Skip reviewing:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Generated files (*.generated.*, protobuf output)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Vendor/third-party code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Minor formatting issues that a linter should catch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Comments and documentation unless factually wrong</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2. 要求给出具体的修复建议</strong></p>\n<p>只有&quot;这里有 bug&quot;的评论对工程师帮助有限。有效的审查评论需要给出具体的修复方向：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"For each finding, provide:&#10;- A specific &quot;suggestion&quot; field with either corrected code or clear remediation steps&#10;- Not just &quot;this is wrong&quot; but &quot;consider changing X to Y because Z&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>For each finding, provide:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- A specific \"suggestion\" field with either corrected code or clear remediation steps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Not just \"this is wrong\" but \"consider changing X to Y because Z\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>3. 区分&quot;必须修复&quot;和&quot;建议改进&quot;</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Use severity levels:&#10;- critical: Must be fixed before merge (bugs, security issues)&#10;- warning: Should be addressed (performance, maintainability)&#10;- suggestion: Optional improvement (style, readability)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Use severity levels:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- critical: Must be fixed before merge (bugs, security issues)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- warning: Should be addressed (performance, maintainability)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- suggestion: Optional improvement (style, readability)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>4. 注入团队上下文（可选但高效）</strong></p>\n<p>对于有历史数据的团队，在 Prompt 中注入已知的误报模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const teamContext = await loadTeamContext(); // 从历史数据库加载&#10;const enrichedPrompt = `${SYSTEM_PROMPT}&#10;&#10;Team-specific context:&#10;- This codebase uses ${teamContext.framework} with ${teamContext.patterns}&#10;- Known false positive patterns to skip: ${teamContext.falsePositives.join(&#39;, &#39;)}`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> teamContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadTeamContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 从历史数据库加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enrichedPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Team-specific context:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- This codebase uses ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">teamContext</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">framework</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} with ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">teamContext</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">patterns</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark